# Requirements and Constraints

## Active requirements

No project-specific requirement has been accepted yet.

## Proposed requirements

Capture proposed requirements with a basis, owner, status, and validation
method. Do not relabel a proposal as accepted without valid authority.

## Hard boundaries

- The dossier does not grant permission.
- Current-state claims require direct evidence.
- Unknown project facts remain unknown.
- Real secrets and unnecessary personal data do not belong in the dossier.
